{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01TcPEzKNk667xsagk1vafRb", "type": "tool_result", "content": "{\"result\":\"- `await orders_list_order_ids()` \u2014 List every order id in the store. [mcp:orders/list_order_ids]\\n- `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)` \u2014 Fetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status. [mcp:orders/get_order]\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited \u2014 fan out slow tools instead of paying N x latency: `futures = [fn(x=i) for i in ids]` then `results = [await f for f in futures]`.\\nThe namespace also binds surfaces search does not list: `save_result`/`load_result`.\\nDetails only when needed: toolplane://namespace (full manifest) and skill://driving-toolplane/SKILL.md (conventions).\"}"}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "a6d76d50-51a6-4484-83c8-61e681907754", "uuid": "93dd78ae-f3d2-49b1-a7ba-66be280a6bae", "timestamp": "2026-10-08T08:17:33.723Z", "tool_use_result": {"content": "{\"result\":\"- `await orders_list_order_ids()` \u2014 List every order id in the store. [mcp:orders/list_order_ids]\\n- `await orders_get_order(order_id=<string>)` \u2014 Fetch one order record: order_id, region, amount, status. [mcp:orders/get_order]\\n\\nRules for execute_code snippets: every binding is async \u2014 always `await`; call capability functions with keywords exactly as shown (positional calls fail on the default backend); awaiting a capability returns the tool's plain value, already unwrapped \u2014 never index into a ['result'] or ['value'] envelope; `return` a JSON-shaped value.\\nCalls dispatch when invoked, not when awaited